msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The swordsman—who had been silently observing⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the lord and the boy "
"conversing—interjected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Мечник – который молчаливо наблюдал⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫за беседой лорда и юноши – вмешался,"

#: search2:search2_C396F1A2_065E_47D4_A632_E6625AAA9A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5ee4c3399a4b59376648e26666bb0b2b251a2b07ee29cd567b16522e7dd28b6
